# Line endings are LF everywhere, on every platform. A shell script checked out with CRLF fails in ways that do not
# mention line endings (README, "What you need"), and a Solidity file with CRLF changes every hash in a manifest.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sol text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
